Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:05:23 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 07/36] bitproxy: Apply button with libbox check and restore

Apply resolves live uids, generates the config, validates it with
Libbox.checkConfig and only then writes it (atomically) into a Local
profile named BitProxy, selects it and reloads the running service. On
any error the running config is untouched and the error is shown. The
config active before the latest Apply is kept and can be restored. The
last result is recorded for diagnostics.
